self?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: For sure! Cairo is a fascinating city. The people on the street were very nice. The traffic was crazy though.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: How were the drivers?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They were okay, but my tour guide almost ran someone over when we were driving to the pyramids! He braked just in time.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Oh no! Did anyone get injured?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not seriously, thank goodness! I was wearing my seatbelt when it happened. I just had whiplash for a few days after. And the tour guide bumped his head on the windscreen!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Did it hurt? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not as much as Vanessa's ankle at the Grand Canyon.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: What happened?", "time": "24500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob06re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She sprained her ankle badly when we were hiking by ourselves. She was looking at the map and she stepped into a hole!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Ouch! At least it wasn't life-threatening!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. Always look on the bright side.", "time": "38500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}